---
layout: "solution.njk"
title: "Press Room | Teamwork Commerce"
description: "News, company facts, and media contacts for Teamwork Commerce: the unified commerce platform behind 30,000+ terminals in 40+ countries."
navLabel: "Press Room"
permalink: "/press-room/"
---
<!-- Breadcrumb -->
<div class="container">
  <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="padding: 16px 0; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-faint);">
    <a href="/" style="color: var(--text-muted);">Home</a> <span style="margin: 0 6px;">/</span>
    Press Room
  </nav>
</div>

<!-- ============ HEAD (compact, straight into the releases) ============ -->
<section style="padding: 4px 0 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="blog-head">
      <div class="blog-head-eyebrow">Press Room</div>
      <h1 class="blog-h1">Teamwork Commerce press room.</h1>
      <p class="blog-head-sub">Announcements, partnerships, and deployments, newest first. For media, analyst, and speaking inquiries, <a href="/contact/">contact us directly</a>: our team responds personally, not through a ticket queue.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ LATEST PRESS RELEASES ============ -->
<section class="section" id="releases" style="padding-top: 6px;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="prl-list">
      {% for post in collections.blogpost | inCategory("News") %}
      <a class="prl-item" href="{{ post.url }}">
        <span class="prl-date">{{ post.data.date | formatDate }}</span>
        <span class="prl-text">
          <span class="prl-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
          {% if post.data.dek %}<span class="prl-dek">{{ post.data.dek }}</span>{% endif %}
        </span>
        <i class="ti ti-arrow-right prl-arrow"></i>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ COVERAGE AREAS ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">What We Cover</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Topics we can speak to.</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Reporters and analysts typically reach out to us in one of these areas. If your story spans more than one, our team will loop in the right people.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillars-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);">
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="ti ti-rocket"></i></div>
        <h3 class="pillar-title">Product & platform news</h3>
        <p class="pillar-desc">Updates on Mobile POS, RFID, Inventory Control, OMS, and the rest of the platform, what's shipping and why it matters for retail operators.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="ti ti-building-store"></i></div>
        <h3 class="pillar-title">Company news</h3>
        <p class="pillar-desc">Leadership, partnerships, certifications, and milestones across our 40+ country footprint.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="ti ti-users"></i></div>
        <h3 class="pillar-title">Customer & case studies</h3>
        <p class="pillar-desc">How retailers like Petco Mexico, ASICS, and Acne Studios put the platform to work at scale.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="ti ti-microphone"></i></div>
        <h3 class="pillar-title">Executive commentary</h3>
        <p class="pillar-desc">Perspective on unified commerce, RFID adoption, and the retail technology market from our leadership team.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ COMPANY FACT SHEET ============ -->
<section style="padding: 80px 0; background: var(--bg-deep); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 48px; text-align: center;">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Company Fact Sheet</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Company facts and figures.</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 12px;">
      <div style="padding: 28px; background: var(--bg-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); text-align: center;">
        <div style="font-size: 40px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--text);">30<span style="font-size: 20px;">+</span></div>
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; margin-top: 6px;">Years of retail DNA</div>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 28px; background: var(--bg-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); text-align: center;">
        <div style="font-size: 40px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--text);">30,000<span style="font-size: 20px;">+</span></div>
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; margin-top: 6px;">Terminals worldwide</div>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 28px; background: var(--bg-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); text-align: center;">
        <div style="font-size: 40px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--text);">40<span style="font-size: 20px;">+</span></div>
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; margin-top: 6px;">Countries localized</div>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 28px; background: var(--bg-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); text-align: center;">
        <div style="font-size: 40px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--text);">99.99<span style="font-size: 20px;">%</span></div>
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; margin-top: 6px;">Platform uptime</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px; margin-top: 32px;">Founder-led. Engineered for the platform. Trusted by ASICS, Acne Studios, Petco, The Row, Colorado Rockies, City Beach, The Broad, and Lucchese. See our <a href="/about/" style="color: var(--brand-text);">full company story</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ MEDIA CONTACT ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 700px; text-align: center;">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Media Contact</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Media and analyst inquiries.</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">For media, analyst, and speaking inquiries, please contact us, we'll route your request to the right person on our team, usually within one business day.</p>
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" style="margin-top: 8px;">Want to collaborate? <i class="ti ti-arrow-right"></i></a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ FINAL CTA ============ -->
<section class="final-cta">
  <div class="container final-cta-inner">
    <h2>See what we're doing in the <span class="gradient-text">news.</span></h2>
    <p>For media, analyst, and speaking inquiries, please contact us.</p>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Connect with Teamwork <i class="ti ti-arrow-right"></i></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
